utions can be customized for specific operational needs, such as delivery, aerial surveillance, and infrastructure inspection. This adaptability ensures our technology meets the unique requirements of various industries. Weather and Lighting Adaptability Equipped with advanced modeling of environmental conditions, our technology handles diverse weather scenarios, including rain, fog, and varying times of day. Shadows, glare, and lighting changes are integrated into the perception system to ensure robust performance under real-world conditions. Enhanced Tracking and Identification Capabilities By integrating advanced recognition and annotation features, our technology supports the tracking and identification of objects, vehicles, and infrastructure. These capabilities are invaluable for surveillance, security, and asset monitoring applications. Dynamic Obstacle Detection and Collision Avoidance Our technology incorporates dynamic elements like moving pedestrians, vehicles, and airborne objects, enabling drones to respond intelligently to sudden changes in their surroundings. These features are critical for developing reliable collision avoidance and safe navigation. CONTACT US Have any questions? Send us a message. First Name Last Name Work Email Company Newsletter I would like to receive the Cognata newsletter Policy By submitting this form, you agree your personal information will be handled in accordance with Cognata's privacy policy. The datasets are governed by the Dataset License Terms * Send TERMS OF USE PRIVACY POLICY MEDIA KIT STANDARD EULA TERMS DATASET LICENSE TERMS OF USE PRIVACY POLICY MEDIA KIT STANDARD EULA TERMS DATASET LICENSE Twitter Facebook-f Linkedin-in Youtube All rights reserved © 2025 Cognata This website uses cookies to improve your experience. We'll assume you're ok with this, but you can opt-out if you wish. Cookie settings ACCEPT Privacy & Cookies Policy Close Privacy Overview This website uses cookies to improve your experience while you 