mart Cities Agriculture Construction & Mining AMR (Warehouse) COMPANY Partners CAREERS NEWSROOM News Press releases Blog Videos Newsletters Products Cognata Off-Road AVBox OneSim DriveMatrix DriveMatrix Highway Dataset Sensor Hub (ADPH) ADAS Safety Regulations Simulation Autonomous Drone Simulation Sensor Simulation Closed-Loop Simulations Large-Scale Scenario Generation Off-road AV simulation Academy Validation White-Paper HIL – Hardware in the Loop DIL – Driver in the Loop Datasets DriveMatrix Highway Dataset Traffic Light Datasets Traffic Signs Pedestrian Datasets Vehicle Datasets Datasets White-Paper Autonomous Drone Simulation Industries Defense Autonomous Vehicles Smart Cities Agriculture Construction & Mining AMR (Warehouse) COMPANY Partners CAREERS NEWSROOM News Press releases Blog Videos Newsletters Large-Scale Scenario Generation Cognata’s scalable elastic cloud capacity simplifies large-scale scenario generation. Get started right away with our libraries of common standard scenarios or create your own with the Cognata Studio UI and ASAM OpenSCENARIO® scripting capabilities. Request a Free Evaluation Scenario generation Cognata simplifies the creation of parameterizable scenarios ranging from simple maneuvers to complex multi-agent urban interaction. Author and scale your scenarios easily with our industry-leading Studio UI or powerful scripting capabilities, including ASAM OpenSCENARIO ® support. Scenario library The Cognata platform is delivered with a library of customizable ready-to-run scenarios. The scenario library can be easily modified and customized, or extended with your own proprietary authored scenarios. Testing & Analysis Our scalable cloud architecture and powerful orchestration interfaces make quick work or large test campaigns. Test architects can choose between our intuitive Studio UI or easy-to-use REST API for running large-scale test plans. Define meaningful KPIs, visualize trends, and extract insights from large-scale test campaigns. 