imulation Quick learner, excellent communicator and real team player Nice-to-Have Extras Experience with game engines (Unreal / Unity) or robotics sims (ROS 2, Isaac Sim, PyBullet) GPU acceleration (CUDA, Numba) or deep-learning frameworks (PyTorch, TensorFlow) Knowledge of computer vision or signal processing Linux, Git, Docker and cloud skills Why Cognata? Front-row seat to the next generation of autonomous-system simulation and GenAI data augmentation Agile startup culture with real ownership of features that ship to tier-one automotive, defense and robotics customers Competitive compensation, stock-option plan and flexible work arrangements Ready to accelerate autonomy? Send your CV to cv@cognata.com with the subject “Junior Algorithm Engineer”. (Only suitable candidates will be contacted.) CONTACT US Have any questions? Send us a message. First Name Last Name Work Email Company Newsletter I would like to receive the Cognata newsletter Policy By submitting this form, you agree your personal information will be handled in accordance with Cognata's privacy policy. The datasets are governed by the Dataset License Terms * Send TERMS OF USE PRIVACY POLICY MEDIA KIT STANDARD EULA TERMS DATASET LICENSE TERMS OF USE PRIVACY POLICY MEDIA KIT STANDARD EULA TERMS DATASET LICENSE Twitter Facebook-f Linkedin-in Youtube All rights reserved © 2025 Cognata This website uses cookies to improve your experience. We'll assume you're ok with this, but you can opt-out if you wish. Cookie settings ACCEPT Privacy & Cookies Policy Close Privacy Overview This website uses cookies to improve your experience while you navigate through the website. Out of these, the cookies that are categorized as necessary are stored on your browser as they are essential for the working of basic functionalities of the website. We also use third-party cookies that help us analyze and understand how you use this website. These cookies will be stored in your browser only with your consent. You also have the o